# Reproducible benchmark summaries are tracked; per-run transcripts, prompts,
# patches, and grader output are local artifacts.
swrm/bench/**/results/raw*/

# The quota-reclaim drill sandbox is a local artifact: it holds throwaway lane
# homes, repos and evidence, and must never dirty the working tree.
.swrm-tmp/

# Stray build artifacts of the lane tooling: a Zig build (uucode) that runs inside
# swrm/tests/ leaves a hidden shared object behind, and `git add -A` used to sweep
# it into the change. The binaries are identical to each other and unrelated to any
# feature, so they must never be tracked.
swrm/tests/.*.so

# Local caches of the test runs: never part of a change.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local temporary test fixtures.
/.t/

# lane 临时目录
.tmp/
